<title>Israel and Hezbollah: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/lebanon/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-lebanon-2026-11-21T19:35:09.017Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 19:35:09 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Israel has intensified airstrikes and artillery against Hezbollah sites in southern Lebanon, including a deep strike on a Hezbollah stronghold and attacks on four districts that caused fires and damage, while occupying Haddatha under a cease-fire. Hezbollah has responded with guerrilla tactics and drone warfare and faces domestic crackdowns, with five members charged with recruiting and arming others and sanctions placed on a charity and gold companies linked to the group. European states are pushing to replace UN peacekeepers as UNIFIL prepares to exit, and the UN Security Council endorsed the mission without naming a successor. The conflict caused 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidEFVX3lxTE5lZUpxM2JnOUkyaWMtTjIwNGxMSVhVMVVmS0VMOGlqdHVadUJzNnFkTnIxOVJYZFBWVTZ5MFc5enpPcllHX1ZrQzR1Q0VKekhpemhqc1d2TThNMks2dzhwZzdGMTlJSlRxVHlPUUdlWkZBRHgy?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxNV0F3Y1JvLW9wV3hKdTF6Vl93cEtyamFFWlJ6eFBMYjFpZW5jNERvNEFya1BOakpvOTZ5UFcxbzhOODlGTjBmV2tXX3U5MHd5QTRPOEt2UzM3bGZlUGNnVmNnTWJKS2lER3pGSzBrM3p2NUoxSGlTUmIwUnlaV3QwRW5kVmZzQU1vb3czckVoalV2RnlyNjFNZE1PcnhHOERabU40?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxQcWJ4Q2toZ0ZreHU4QmNoX0Z3dlVSMkdxY0N4bFR3LU9VYVEyNHlpR2tFNHdDaG45YTNtdUFRampkMVVPNWNYU01udms4ZXAwX1BTWXEwZ1Y0Y21QSi1oc2hqdFNpeUh6ZmxYS3g1aGlpOHBOcXNfSVVOZzBIRDVYcWFB?oc=5&quot;&gt;ReliefWeb&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxQU2RLWUtKeHBxZ3JDX0VmTC1sWnU4cXBSWkNFamFPOVcyaTJCbm1Eb0hpbmNQYjdlWjFoSkxiLURpX25qcjZpMHVac29lMGxCeW9iM3BJeW5WbGtDblBReVdhdHVxYXRf